WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:01.699
- You furry flea!

00:00:01.699 --> 00:00:03.366
- [Narrator] Villains from 80's cartoons

00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:04.881
had a similar sound.

00:00:04.881 --> 00:00:07.054
- You overgrown fur coat!

00:00:07.054 --> 00:00:08.029
You let him get away!

00:00:08.029 --> 00:00:09.184
(click)

00:00:09.184 --> 00:00:10.815
- [Narrator] And there
was a reason for that.

00:00:10.815 --> 00:00:12.623
Most were voiced by this guy.

00:00:12.623 --> 00:00:13.456
- What?

00:00:13.456 --> 00:00:14.295
- [Narrator] Alan Oppenheimer.

00:00:14.295 --> 00:00:17.563
- My name is Alan
Oppenheimer, and I'm an actor.

00:00:17.563 --> 00:00:18.661
- [Narrator] Most famously, he's the voice

00:00:18.661 --> 00:00:20.766
of Falkor from NeverEnding Story,

00:00:20.766 --> 00:00:22.520
and Skeletor from He-Man.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.459
- (evil giggle) Why are you asking me

00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:26.485
these stupid questions?

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:28.153
(villainous laugh)

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:32.111
Get a life! (chuckles)

00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:34.354
Regarding He-Man, Masters of the Universe,

00:00:34.354 --> 00:00:35.604
I was Skeletor.

00:00:36.466 --> 00:00:39.146
I figured the voice would reverberate

00:00:39.146 --> 00:00:40.964
inside that bony head.

00:00:40.964 --> 00:00:43.738
(nasal voice) So that's why
he went up in here, nasal.

00:00:43.738 --> 00:00:45.414
Ha ha ha, you boob!

00:00:45.414 --> 00:00:46.247
You idiot!

00:00:46.247 --> 00:00:47.845
Why are you bothering living!

00:00:47.845 --> 00:00:49.179
(nasal laugh)

00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:50.737
You've got a better life somewhere else.

00:00:50.737 --> 00:00:52.602
Get out of my face.

00:00:52.602 --> 00:00:54.179
- [Narrator] He did some
other villainous voices.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:56.015
- (evil laugh)

00:00:56.015 --> 00:00:59.027
- Grab them, my pet, grab them!

00:00:59.027 --> 00:00:59.860
- Cruelty!

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.016
- Evil!

00:01:02.016 --> 00:01:04.674
- [Narrator] There does seem
to be some relation there.

00:01:04.674 --> 00:01:05.751
- I stole from myself.

00:01:05.751 --> 00:01:08.126
I mean, hey, if I plagiarize myself

00:01:08.126 --> 00:01:10.139
you know, no one can sue me, you know?

00:01:10.139 --> 00:01:12.364
- Come in, you royal boob!

00:01:12.364 --> 00:01:14.942
- [Narrator] But then, there was Falkor.

00:01:14.942 --> 00:01:17.984
- Falkor was the Luck Dragon.

00:01:17.984 --> 00:01:20.247
He's kind and he's big and fuzzy.

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:22.837
- [Falkor] (deep, soothing
voice) My name is Falkor.

00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:25.744
- And he's flying so you have that feel.

00:01:25.744 --> 00:01:26.700
Whoa!

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.177
Let's go!

00:01:28.177 --> 00:01:29.010
Atreyu!

00:01:30.388 --> 00:01:31.221
See?

00:01:31.221 --> 00:01:32.198
- (yelling) Ah!

00:01:32.198 --> 00:01:33.870
- [Narrator] And he actually
did a few other characters

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.163
from NeverEnding Story.

00:01:35.163 --> 00:01:36.950
- Very tasty!

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:37.783
- [Alan] (grumbly voice) Oh, I love...

00:01:37.783 --> 00:01:40.200
Mmm, quartz is so tasty! Mmm!

00:01:42.545 --> 00:01:43.724
Get the picture?

00:01:43.724 --> 00:01:46.261
- [Narrator] Alan’s
had an amazing career.

00:01:46.261 --> 00:01:49.199
For me, though, I like Falkor.

00:01:49.199 --> 00:01:51.817
Alan, will you do the voice again?

00:01:51.817 --> 00:01:55.067
- Atreyu, get on my back and we'll fly!

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:58.790
Oh, there are those bullies,

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:02.689
let's get them! (deep, gentle laugh)

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:06.200
(deep, gentle laugh)

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.332
Okay.

00:02:07.332 --> 00:02:10.427
(friendly laugh)

00:02:10.427 --> 00:02:11.844
- [Narrator] Yes!

00:02:13.638 --> 00:02:15.555
(ding)

